{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人余文樂與陳冠希傳結怨多年，偏偏台灣天王周杰倫與二人都相當老友。</p><p>近日周杰倫上載與余文樂的合照竟引來陳冠希點讚，令他靈機一解充當「和事老」，拉攏兩人「世紀合體」，建議開拍《頭文字D》續集。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;歌手周杰</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T16:27:30.874703+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T16:01:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T16:20:45.983203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T16:20:45.983203+00:00","content_hash":"083ea267d208165cf9157ba539c293161baca4a0db6654754ef79fc3d892c3bf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}